post.description:
This API allows operations user to retrieve a list of summary payee profile information for the requested filter criteria. The API returns summary details of each payee.

The core system will apply the search criteria if they exist, otherwise, all payees will be retrieved and returned. Search Criteria can be any one or multiple values as follows:

- Payee ID
- Account name
- Customer number
- Payee status

The sort order can be ASCENDING, DESCENDING or UNSORTED. The sort field is the column field name used for sorting.

**_Filter Examples_**
- By payee ID
````json
"payeeFilters": {
  "businessProfileFilter": [{
    "payeeFilterId": "PAYEE_ID",
    "filterValue": "d6b3df59138c47cb906b0e37cbe26126"
  }]
}
````
- By account name
````json
"payeeFilters": {
  "businessProfileFilter": [{
    "payeeFilterId": "ACCOUNT_NAME",
    "filterValue": "John Doe"
  }]
}
````
- By account name prefix
````json
"payeeFilters": {
  "businessProfileFilter": [{
    "payeeFilterId": "ACCOUNT_NAME_BEGINS_LIKE",
    "filterValue": "John"
  }]
}
````
- By customer number contains
````json
"payeeFilters": {
  "businessProfileFilter": [{
    "payeeFilterId": "CUSTOMER_NUMBER",
    "filterValue": "24673"
  }]
}
````
- By customer number exact match
````json
"payeeFilters": {
  "businessProfileFilter": [{
    "payeeFilterId": "CUSTOMER_NUMBER_EXACT",
    "filterValue": "3524673847"
  }]
}
````
- By customer number prefix
````json
"payeeFilters": {
  "businessProfileFilter": [{
    "payeeFilterId": "CUSTOMER_NUMBER_BEGINS_LIKE",
    "filterValue": "34"
  }]
}
````
- By status
````json
"payeeFilters": {
  "businessProfileFilter": [{
    "payeeFilterId": "STATUS_IN",
    "filterValue": "ACTIVE"
  }]
}
````
- By excluded status
````json
"payeeFilters": {
  "businessProfileFilter": [{
    "payeeFilterId": "STATUS_NOT_IN",
    "filterValue": "TERMINATED"
  }]
}
````
- Multiple filters
````json
"payeeFilters": {
  "businessProfileFilter": [{
    "payeeFilterId": "STATUS_IN",
    "filterValue": "TERMINATED",
    "logicalOperator": "AND"
  },{
    "payeeFilterId": "ACCOUNT_NAME_BEGINS_LIKE",
    "filterValue": "Jessica"
  }]
}
````

**_Errors_**
- Authorization error.
- Invalid argument.

_Note_: All errors are accompanied by error code and error text.

This API allows operations users to retrieve information about a list of payee users. It returns the summary details of each user, for display in a payee user list.

The core system will apply the search criteria if they exist, otherwise, all payee users will be retrieved and returned based on first name ascending order.

Search Criteria:
- First name
- Last name
- Email
- Payee ID
- Payee user status

The sort order can be ASCENDING, DESCENDING or UNSORTED. The sort field is the column field name used for sorting.

**_Filter Examples_**
- By first name
````json
"merchantUserFilters": {
  "merchantUserFilter": [{
    "merchantUserFilterId": "FIRST_NAME",
    "filterValue": "Roger"
  }]
}
````
- By first name prefix
````json
"merchantUserFilters": {
  "merchantUserFilter": [{
    "merchantUserFilterId": "FIRST_NAME_BEGIN_LIKE",
    "filterValue": "Jes"
  }]
}
````
- By last name
````json
"merchantUserFilters": {
  "merchantUserFilter": [{
    "merchantUserFilterId": "LAST_NAME",
    "filterValue": "Doe"
  }]
}
````
- By last name prefix
````json
"merchantUserFilters": {
  "merchantUserFilter": [{
    "merchantUserFilterId": "LAST_NAME_BEGIN_LIKE",
    "filterValue": "Rab"
  }]
}
````
- By email
````json
"merchantUserFilters": {
  "merchantUserFilter": [{
    "merchantUserFilterId": "EMAIL",
    "filterValue": "thuy.vo3101@gmail.com"
  }]
}
````
- By email prefix
````json
"merchantUserFilters": {
  "merchantUserFilter": [{
    "merchantUserFilterId": "EMAIL_BEGIN_LIKE",
    "filterValue": "jessica"
  }]
}
````
- By payee ID
````json
"merchantUserFilters": {
  "merchantUserFilter": [{
    "merchantUserFilterId": "CUSTOMER_RELATION_ID",
    "filterValue": "d6b3df59138c47cb906b0e37cbe26126"
  }]
}
````
- By excluded statuses
````json
"merchantUserFilters": {
  "merchantUserFilter": [{
    "merchantUserFilterId": "CUSTOMER_STATUS_NOT_IN",
    "filterValue": "EMAIL_SENT,ACTIVE,NOT_VERIFIED"
  }]
},
````
- Multiple filters
````json
"merchantUserFilters": {
  "merchantUserFilter": [{
    "merchantUserFilterId": "EMAIL_BEGIN_LIKE",
    "filterValue": "jessica",
    "logicalOperator": "AND"
  },{
    "merchantUserFilterId": "FIRST_NAME",
    "filterValue": "Roger"
  }]
}
````

**_Errors_**

- Authorization error.
- Invalid argument.

_Note_: All errors are accompanied by error code and error text.

This API allows operations user the ability to retrieve the payment history list for a given filter criteria. The API will return summary details of each order.

The core system will apply the search criteria if they exist, otherwise, all payments will be retrieved and returned based on payment date (created date descending) order. Search Criteria can be any one or multiple values as follows:
- Payment status
- Payment ID
- Payee ID
- Payout date
- Draft number
- Claim number
- Policy number

The sort order can be ASCENDING, DESCENDING or UNSORTED. The sort field is the column field name used for sorting.

**_Filter Examples_**
- By status
````json
"paymentFilters": {
  "paymentFilter":[{
    "paymentFilterId": "STATUS",
    "filterValue": "CANCELLED"
  }]
}
````
- By payment ID
````json
"paymentFilters": {
  "paymentFilter":[{
    "paymentFilterId": "PAYMENT_ID",
    "filterValue": "02f05ad1e5b146389f1b8182d0090c0e"
  }]
}
````
- By payee ID
````json
"paymentFilters": {
  "paymentFilter":[{
    "paymentFilterId": "PAYEE_ID",
    "filterValue": "98c38354137b468cb24c6264355214a5"
  }]
}
````
- By draft number
````json
"paymentFilters": {
  "paymentFilter":[{
    "paymentFilterId": "DRAFT_NUMBER",
    "filterValue": "1817200006"
  }]
}
````
- By draft number prefix
````json
"paymentFilters": {
  "paymentFilter":[{
    "paymentFilterId": "DRAFT_NUMBER_BEGINS_LIKE",
    "filterValue": "181"
  }]
}
````
- By claim number
````json
"paymentFilters": {
  "paymentFilter":[{
    "paymentFilterId": "CLAIM_NUMBER",
    "filterValue": "234353454"
  }]
}
````
- By claim number prefix
````json
"paymentFilters": {
  "paymentFilter":[{
    "paymentFilterId": "CLAIM_NUMBER_BEGINS_LIKE",
    "filterValue": "2343"
  }]
}
````
- By policy number
````json
"paymentFilters": {
  "paymentFilter":[{
    "paymentFilterId": "POLICY_NUMBER",
    "filterValue": "6535345"
  }]
}
````
- By policy number prefix
````json
"paymentFilters": {
  "paymentFilter":[{
    "paymentFilterId": "POLICY_NUMBER_BEGINS_LIKE",
    "filterValue": "653"
  }]
}
````
- By payout date range
````json
"paymentFilters": {
  "paymentFilter":[{
    "paymentFilterId": "START_PAYOUT_DATE",
    "filterValue": "2018-01-01 00:00:00",
    "logicalOperator": "AND"
  },{
    "paymentFilterId": "END_PAYOUT_DATE",
    "filterValue": "2018-06-01 23:59:59"
  }]
}
````

**_Errors_**

- Authorization error.
- Invalid argument.

_Note_: All errors are accompanied by error code and error text.
